1:1 COMMENT "# generator_intrange.z -- a generator with construction state."
1:63 EOL "\n"
2:1 COMMENT "#"
2:2 EOL "\n"
3:1 COMMENT "# `IntRange` yields i64 values from `lo` (inclusive) up to `hi`"
3:64 EOL "\n"
4:1 COMMENT "# (exclusive). `lo` and `hi` are its `is` fields -- the state it is"
4:68 EOL "\n"
5:1 COMMENT "# built with -- and `call` reads them through `this`. The loop"
5:63 EOL "\n"
6:1 COMMENT "# counter `i` is an ordinary local that happens to live across a"
6:65 EOL "\n"
7:1 COMMENT "# suspension, so the compiler promotes it to a field and drives it"
7:67 EOL "\n"
8:1 COMMENT "# from the state machine; nothing about it is written here."
8:60 EOL "\n"
9:1 COMMENT "#"
9:2 EOL "\n"
10:1 COMMENT "# Demonstrates: a generator with fields and a yielding loop. See"
10:65 EOL "\n"
11:1 COMMENT "# doc/spec.pdoc Generator functions."
11:37 EOL "\n"
12:1 EOL "\n"
